    },
    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-76.t04",
      "en": "A holiday in Paris will not break the bank if we book early.",
      "es": "Unas vacaciones en París no arruinarán el presupuesto si reservamos pronto.",
      "explanationEs": "Break the bank: costar demasiado dinero; aquí, con not, significa que es asequible.",
      "segments": [
        "A holiday in Paris will not break",
        "the bank if we book early."
      ],
      "audioText": "A holiday in Paris will not break the bank if we book early.",
